1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,500
Text: 'Each Event is preceded by Prophecy. But without the hero, there is no Event.' Zurin Arctus, the Underking.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Text scrolls: 'In the waning years of the Third Era of Tamriel, a prisoner born on a certain day to uncertain parents was sent under guard, without explanation, to Morrowind, ignorant of the role he was to play in that nation's history...'

3
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,500
A desolate wasteland emerges beneath a thick, blood-red fog.

4
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,000
Glowing runes drift through the mist.

5
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,000
The runes dissolve into text: 'Many fall, but one remains.'

6
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,000
Torrential rain pours over a swamp where a shirtless dark elf stands at the shore.

7
00:00:49,500 --> 00:00:51,000
Surreal visions flash of a moon in space and ocean islands at night.

8
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,000
A wooden ship railing sinks into water beneath a stormy sky, fading to black.
